~ convo_1
Fenn: Hey Wizard man, do you like ice cream?
Winston: Woooow. Asking thy 'ice guy' if he liketh ice cream. Very original.
Fenn: Well... you call me 'pint-size.' So... do you?
Winston: Wha- NO!!
Winston: Tis a mockery of nature. An insult to everything which is cold.
Fenn: Are you lactose intolerant?
Winston: And there thou goes! Assuming I'm lactose intolerant just because I liketh not ice cream!
Fenn: Well, are you?
Winston: Tis besides the point!
Fenn: Huh... no wonder all those ice creams are so mad.
#do EventFlags.set_flag("F-1-Ws-CellarGeneral", true)
=> END

~ convo_2
Winston: Go away, pint-size.
Fenn: Why?
Winston: Um... Shut up! I doth be busy! Go away.
Fenn: Aw okay.
#do EventFlags.set_flag("F-2-Ws-CellarGeneral", true)
=> END

~ convo_3
Winston: Hey, pint-size, you seem close with Az.
Fenn: Oh yeah! She's great.
Winston: D-Does she, like... I dunno... 
Fenn: What?
Winston: What doth she, like, think? Liketh regarding me?
Winston: Doth she thinketh I'm cool?
Fenn: Yeah of course! Everyone thinks you're cool!
Winston: Really?!
Az: NO! Fenn, stop making stuff up.
Fenn: But I wasn't...
Winston whispering: I forgoteth she was there...
#do EventFlags.set_flag("F-3-Ws-CellarGeneral", true)
=> END

~ convo_4
Fenn: Where'd you get your coat?
Winston: Oh. Well, my Mother madeth it.
Fenn: That's really nice! You must have a really cool Mom.
Winston: Yeah... wouldst be. If she even cared.
Fenn: What do you mean?
Winston: Nothing. Worry not 'bout it.
#do EventFlags.set_flag("F-4-Ws-CellarGeneral", true)
=> END

#Potentially delete if this conversation is moved to when the player meets winston
~ convo_5
Winston: Just thee wait, pint-size! I shall destroyeth thee!
Fenn: That's the spirit!
Az: Are you rooting for him?
Fenn: Of course! The hero is nothing without his villain!
Az: Eh. Fair enough, I guess.
Az: I also get the feeling he needs it.
Winston: Do not pity me!!
#do EventFlags.set_flag("F-5-Ws-CellarGeneral", true)
=> END

~ convo_6
Fenn: Mr. Wizard?
Winston: Go away! I am planning thy demise.
Fenn: What's demise mean?
Winston: Um... VERY PAINFUL DEATH!!
Fenn: Oh... cool!
=> END

~ convo_7
Fenn: Hey Wizard Guy, what do you do for fun?
Winston: Hmph. Why do thee careth?
Fenn: I dunno.
Winston: Well, I readeth, I suppose.
Fenn: Read what?
Winston: Uh... liketh, mysteries and detective stories.
Fenn: That's super cool! I like comic books. Do you read comics? I love Garbage Man, he's my favorite. Have you heard of Garbage Man? He defeats the bad guys with his overwhelming-
Winston: Uhhhhh...
Az: Fenn! Stop bothering the squatter. He's busy being a freak, or whatever.
Winston: HEY!
=> END

~ convo_8
Winston: Grrr, I feel rather peckish...
Fenn: Aw... do you have any food?
Winston: No. Maybe the workshop hath snacks.
pause
Winston: Well, I foundeth some walnuts. Ho, pint-size. Couldst thee ask Az if I may have some?
Fenn: Hey Az! Can Wizard man hath some of the walnuts in your workshop?
Az: What??? I guess?? But you mess up my workshop, I'll crush you.
Winston: Score! Walnuts be mine!
=> END

~ convo_9
Fenn: Hey Mr. Wizard. Who's your favorite Knight?
Winston: None of them! They're terrible! They don't do anything for the Kingdom!!!
Fenn: Okay... but if you have to pick?
Winston: Well... probably like... the Knight of Fury. She seemeth cool.
Fenn: Rose? I wouldn't have guessed that... I thought maybe Henric or something.
Winston: Well it doth not matter anyway! They're all stupid and lame!
Fenn: Okay then!
=> END

~ convo_10
Fenn: Why'd you trap all the Knights and stuff??
Wizard: Because they deserve it! 
Fenn: What?! No they didn't! They help so many people!
Wizard: Who?! What do they even do-eth? Sitteth 'round and bicker over meaningless laws?
Wizard: Forget it. I has't to runneth. Evil plans to maketh, traps to setteth, enemies to sendeth, you know.
Fenn: Yeah, I get it.
Wizard: Um. Goodbye, pint-size.
Fenn: Bye bye!
Winston leaves
Fenn: What a formidable foe...
Az: Seriously?
=> END

~ convo_11
Winston: Hey, pint-size. Is Az there?
Fenn: Yeah? Well, her bangle is.
Winston: Wh-what doth she be doing?
Fenn: I dunno. Standing, maybe?
Winston: Hmph. Tis cool. Cool. That's cool. Whatevereth.
=> END
